	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 548.955 106.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0849c158-c13a-5935-9c4e-36f6b3979298")
	)
	(text "AL: TURN-OFF BUFFER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 443.463 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c06bea8-9b66-591d-b3ad-b31ca1ddfa44")
	)
	(text "IN+ = own PWM; IN- = complementary switch, falling edge stretched 3.65k/100p\n(interlock + min dead time = max(firmware, hardware)). Bias PG (active low) pulls RDY low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 107.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d66d709-8748-59f3-aa3f-9fa8d36545dc")
	)
	(text "2 x ZXTP25040DFH emitter followers on OUTL (B-E 1k, C to VEE): each sinks the Roff current of 3 gates;\nthe NSI6651 supplies base current only. Turn-on stays on OUTH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 443.463 71.252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "157a4323-b700-5574-89c3-81642e45525f")
	)
	(text "Gate and Kelvin of each device as coupled pairs of equal length from the COM star; Ron, Roff, Kelvin R, 10k + 1n,\nZeners and the clamp FET + C_VL at each device (loop <= 1 nH). PNP followers next to their three gates. DESAT\nstring >= 2.5 mm pad gap per diode; coat to PD1. Miller hold of six gates NOT simulated - BENCH TEST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 306.856 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "15ad0551-cda3-508b-92a1-7e0ebc3ad292")
	)
	(text "SN6505B push-pull 420 kHz from +5V, BIAS_EN high = on; T_BIAS4 custom, functional insulation\n(PD-free >= 1.75 kVpk, <= 5 pF per secondary). Per channel: bridge, PNP regulator VDD-VEE, ATL431 COM split."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109 276.856 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4e566078-5bb9-5f8a-b907-028759fc1703")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 660.3058 82.392 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4f94e09c-2522-5ee1-bdaa-2759254abe7b")
	)
